== Dataflows

[TIP]
====
{{#if (eq ../variant "trustBoundary")}}
These are the dataflows that cross this trust boundary. To add a dataflow, open the element inside the boundary that sends or receives it.
{{else}}
Use the buttons in this section to add dataflows to and from other elements of this threat model. Give each dataflow a short description of the data, such as "Sensor readings".{{#unless (eq ../variant "external")}} If you model interfaces, add incoming dataflows on the interface and not on this {{#if (eq ../variant "process")}}process{{/if}}{{#if (eq ../variant "dataStore")}}data store{{/if}}.{{/unless}}
{{/if}}
